    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75630" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστρᾰκ-ίνδα</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>played with potsherds</i> or
				<i>oystershells</i> (the black and white surfaces being
			analogous to our 'heads and tails'), [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδιά</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
				<u>in Phdr.</u>
				p.90
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>: with a play on 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστρακισμός, ὀ. βλέψαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					855
				</span></i>
			.</div>
